WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.685
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: AI Quiz Maker for Study.

2
00:00:06.985 --> 00:00:11.727
Make practice questions and test yourself. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.717 --> 00:00:18.968
Step one. Ask for five multiple-choice questions on your topic and level, with answers at the end.

4
00:00:19.983 --> 00:00:23.869
Step two. Read the questions. Cover the answers.

5
00:00:24.883 --> 00:00:29.767
Step three. Answer all the questions before you look. Then check your score.

6
00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:37.978
Step four. Ask the AI to explain the ones you got wrong. This is the best way to learn from mistakes.

7
00:00:38.983 --> 00:00:43.157
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:43.457 --> 00:00:46.826
Make a 5-question quiz on a topic you study.

9
00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:49.079
Do it without looking at the answers.

10
00:00:49.379 --> 00:00:51.982
Ask for explanations for your mistakes.

11
00:00:52.282 --> 00:00:53.365
Well done!

